    schema:description "Argues AML compliance from the end-of-year audits: one claim per audited year, then one per AML requirement, evidenced by the auditor’s requirement files."@en ;
    gsn:intent "Establish AML compliance for an organisation from the evidence its end-of-year audits produce, without fixing the number of years or requirements in advance."@en ;
    gsn:applicability "Applies where the auditor issues a per-year requirement catalogue for the Anti-Money Laundering requirements, with one file of evidence per requirement."@en ;
    gsn:statement "Argument from end-of-year AML auditing." ;
    gsn:argumentType "risk" ;
